     C                   MOVEL(P)  WKJNAM        WAOUJNAM                       JOBNAME
     C                   Z-ADD     WKJDAT        WAOUJDAT                       JOBDATUM
     C                   Z-ADD     WKJZEI        WAOUJZEI                       JOBZEIT
