     C                   Z-ADD     WAOUJDAT      WKJDAT                         JOBDATUM
     C                   Z-ADD     WAOUJZEI      WKJZEI                         JOBZEIT
     C                   MOVEL(P)  WAOUUSER      WKUSER                         USER
     C                   MOVEL(P)  WAOUPROG      WKPROG                         PROGRAMM
     C                   MOVEL(P)  WAOUBIBL      WKBIBL                         BIBLIOTHEK
     C                   ENDIF
     C*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
